{"hero":{"id":85,"name":"Solomon","nameRu":"Соломон","className":"hero_chessmaster","description":"В мире, полном суеты, Соломон охотно остановится и уделит внимание любому, кто в нём нуждается. За шахматной партией ему не раз доводилось дружески беседовать и делиться мудростью с туристами, преступниками и титанами индустрии. Но кем бы ни был его соперник, Соломон всегда невозмутим... Ведь для него шахматы — это гораздо больше, чем просто игра.  Это уравнитель.  Способ общаться на равных с людьми из любых слоёв общества.","descriptionEn":"In a world that moves too fast, Solomon is content to stop and listen. Offering a friendly ear and good counsel, Solomon has found himself sitting across the chess table from tourists, criminals, and titans of industry.  But no matter his opponent, Solomon remains un-phased... because to him, chess is so much more than a game. It's an equalizer. A way for him to connect to people from all walks of life on an even playing field.","lore":"In a world that moves too fast, Solomon is content to stop and listen. Offering a friendly ear and good counsel, Solomon has found himself sitting across the chess table from tourists, criminals, and titans of industry.  But no matter his opponent, Solomon remains un-phased... because to him, chess is so much more than a game. It's an equalizer. A way for him to connect to people from all walks of life on an even playing field.","heroRole":"","tags":["Стратег","Сосредоточенный","Вдумчивый"],"heroType":"mystic","complexity":1,"colorHex":"#AA9E7E","iconCard":"https://assets-bucket.deadlock-api.com/assets-api-res/images/heroes/chessmaster_card.png","iconSmall":"https://assets-bucket.deadlock-api.com/assets-api-res/images/heroes/chessmaster_sm.png","startingStats":{"max_move_speed":6.7,"sprint_speed":3.25,"crouch_speed":4.75,"move_acceleration":4,"light_melee_damage":50,"heavy_melee_damage":116,"max_health":780,"weapon_power":0,"reload_speed":1,"weapon_power_scale":1,"proc_build_up_rate_scale":1,"stamin